      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T17:25:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After trying various setups, it appears that building with Xcode 12+ and running on iOS 13.6 causes CFBundleCopyResourceURL to hang when it should return NULL.\n\nThe plan is to move all the oldest supported iOS testing to the iPhone 8 with iOS 13.3.1 (which does not have the CFBundleCopyResourceURL issue). After doing this we can update the iPhone 11 devices to a much newer iOS version for better testing.",
